# pop'n music 12 Iroha, NET TAISEN alone (popn12-eamuse-on.his first, same --nvram, no card.bin yet;
# the event phase at 2 or more: tools/unlock.py --nvram DIR popn12 phase=2). A new card's credit as
# popn12-card-new.his up to the PIN; then the mode wheel one to the left (Button 4) to NET対戦, red;
# the explainer skipped (red); ROOM SELECT left to its 30 s timer; song select while the lobby looks
# for opponents (E12 game get: matching_sec 30; lob0 list, entry, then leave at the end); nobody
# comes, so the game says so and starts the credit in CHALLENGE mode (NORMA SELECT). docs/EAMUSE3.md
#   hiraku-popn12 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn12-nettaisen.his
game popn12
at 4500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4540 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5050 press "Card" 8
at 5400 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 5700 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 5760 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 5820 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 11700 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 11730 press "Keypad 2" 8
at 11760 press "Keypad 3" 8
at 11790 press "Keypad 4" 8
at 11820 press "Keypad Enter" 8
at 12100 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 12130 press "Keypad 2" 8
at 12160 press "Keypad 3" 8
at 12190 press "Keypad 4" 8
at 12220 press "Keypad Enter" 8
at 12900 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 13050 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 13300 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 15200 snap   # ROOM SELECT
at 16000 snap   # song select, the lobby looking (受付中)
at 17250 snap   # nobody came: CHALLENGE mode
at 18000 snap   # NORMA SELECT
at 18010 quit
